if {CKP.MarjorieHasSpoken} == true:
	CKP_Marjorie: What is it that you want?
else:
	CKP_Marjorie: Sush, you devil. Don’t interrupt my pa’s stories. Unless you have something more interesting to discuss?
label Questions
- Did you see me last night?
	Devin: Did we meet last evening?
	CKP_Marjorie: No, dearie. Pa was telling one of his most thrilling tales from the war. Sicily, of all places. Lucifer himself may have waltzed in and I would not have turned me head.
	Devin: But I was here.
	CKP_Marjorie: Yes of course, but I just didn’t pay you no mind.
	jump Questions
- Were can I find Buckley?
	Devin: Have you seen our mayor?
	CKP_Marjorie: Our mayor? You have not been here but a few days, hunter. He was just here, nonetheless. That bloody weasel, has he scurried off already?
	Devin: I was hoping that you could tell me.
	CKP_Marjorie: Hope springs eternal in the human breast, hunter.
	jump Questions
- Fare thee well.
	Devin: Until next time.
	CKP_Marjorie: See you, hunter.
	if {CKP.NumSetMarjorie} == false:
		set {Silas.5BTalked} += 1
		set {CKP.NumSetMarjorie} = true
	set {CKP.MarjorieHasSpoken} = true
	[end_timeline]
